bout \\\"us\\\" and \\\"them\\\"'),(7938,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8512','2008-08-29 17:04:22','i think the one that done ymca was funny and cool'),(7939,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=8121c4ee-94d3-47a6-b8a6-4a12c181621f&MatchID1=4770&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=10&MatchType1=2&SeriesID1=1206&PrimaryID=4770&Headline=Noted+industrialist+KK+Birla+dies+at+90&strParent=strParentID','guest5258','2008-08-29 22:19:06','hey anybody around?'),(7940,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7460','2008-08-29 22:27:39','is there any1 from Oregon in here?'),(7941,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=8121c4ee-94d3-47a6-b8a6-4a12c181621f&MatchID1=4770&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=10&MatchType1=2&SeriesID1=1206&PrimaryID=4770&Headline=Noted+industrialist+KK+Birla+dies+at+90&strParent=strParentID','guest7886','2008-08-29 22:32:33','I it was very sad.'),(7942,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=8121c4ee-94d3-47a6-b8a6-4a12c181621f&MatchID1=4770&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=10&MatchType1=2&SeriesID1=1206&PrimaryID=4770&Headline=Noted+industrialist+KK+Birla+dies+at+90&strParent=strParentID','guest7886','2008-08-29 22:33:40','i have heard not seen him he is brilliant person.'),(7943,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=19583953-7c61-4e81-9c33-6cda38f39132&&Headline=US+denies+visa+to+Narendra+Modi&strParent=strParentID','guest6188','2008-08-29 23:44:18','Modi is a twice elected Chief minister who has won with large majority.The US congresswoman is interfering in the internal affairs of India by mudslinging against elcetd Chief Minister.He can become athe Primeminister of India in fututre .The US govenment is just burning their goodwill by making a judgement over the peoples choice.They will regret it in future.'),(7944,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=19583953-7c61-4e81-9c33-6cda38f39132&&Headline=US+denies+visa+to+Narendra+Modi&strParent=strParentID','guest4227','2008-08-30 00:38:48','US hypocrisy again... Russia answered last week and India would reply next year. They can kill millions and be puritanical. I just hope one day a bus load of catholics are burnt by terrorists and people of US and senator would quietly sit ...'),(7945,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=47198453-7312-4fa6-a237-ac1fe76bbe71&&Headline=Goodbye+Musharraf&strParent=strParentID','ktmail','2008-08-30 00:49:02','It is very pleasing to note that we have at least one Indian in Vir Shanghvi who remmembers that millitancy in Kashmir  was sponsered  and started by Benazir Bhutto and was carried forward by who so ever in Power in pakistan.'),(7946,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=47198453-7312-4fa6-a237-ac1fe76bbe71&&Headline=Goodbye+Musharraf&strParent=strParentID','ktmail','2008-08-30 00:51:02','These same very Leaders of Pakistan,when ever in Personel trouble would call upon indian Leaders and even visited them personnaly.'),(7947,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=47198453-7312-4fa6-a237-ac1fe76bbe71&&Headline=Goodbye+Musharraf&strParent=strParentID','ktmail','2008-08-30 00:52:29','So,Let\\\'s wait for the General...........'),(7948,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?id=386fba3a-8f3e-4f91-93ea-84b4a74b7517','guest9237','2008-08-30 00:53:10','its an article written in bad taste and is a horrible article.. shame on you miss swaha sahoo. you don\\\'t know the ethics of journalism and don\\\'t deserve to be one!!'),(7949,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=19583953-7c61-4e81-9c33-6cda38f39132&&Headline=US+denies+visa+to+Narendra+Modi&strParent=strParentID','guest9615','2008-08-30 02:49:40','over 3000 innocents were killed and it let to the US attacks in the middle-east. Is Modi doing anything that is different?'),(7950,'www.bollyarm.in','guest2697','2008-08-30 05:34:18','hiii'),(7951,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?id=ceac87c0-0810-