d their life time and treasure in the upliftment of our poor brethren such as Panas and Kandhas is seen as bad. On the other hand when foreign missionaries spend time and money it is considered good thing. It was only 60 years ago thet we threw out Christian rulers to gain our independance. It is important that encourage Hindus to help our poor sections and teach them our Values based on Sanatana Dharma nor foreign concepts of Christianity which Europeans and Americans are rejecting in favor of etenrnal and everlasting Hinduism.'),(8081,'www.hindustantimes.in/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest1638','2008-09-02 13:21:49','And Hindustantimes.com, it is shameful for you to allw such persons'),(8082,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest3506','2008-09-02 13:22:13','Look around the whole world is adopting Yoga and other Hindu and Buddhist principles to guide their life.'),(8083,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest3506','2008-09-02 13:22:33','We were taught that the name of India, our motherland is Hindustan the land of Hindus. So why is it that when Hindus spend their life time and treasure in the upliftment of our poor brethren such as Panas and Kandhas is seen as bad. On the other hand when foreign missionaries spend time and money it is considered good thing. It was only 60 years ago thet we threw out Christian rulers to gain our independance. It is important that encourage Hindus to help our poor sections and teach them our Values based on Sanatana Dharma nor foreign concepts of Christianity which Europeans and Americans are rejecting in favor of etenrnal and everlasting Hinduism.'),(8084,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest3506','2008-09-02 13:23:36','Look around the whole world is adopting Yoga and other Hindu and Buddhist principles to guide their life.'),(8085,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest3506','2008-09-02 13:25:22','Unfortunately we have leftits like Mr. Pati who would like Hindustan to become Christan so that we loose our freedom and independance and once agian become vassals of foreigners.'),(8086,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest3506','2008-09-02 13:27:30','Hira Fotedar'),(8087,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest824','2008-09-02 13:34:18','these are very poop people'),(8088,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest824','2008-09-02 13:34:23','they are uneducated'),(8089,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest824','2008-09-02 13:34:35','and I think are influenced by politicians'),(8090,'www.hindustantimes.in/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest824','2008-09-02 13:36:44','we should not blams ht.com'),(8091,'www.hindustantimes.in/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6d2a5ff7-1561-44f9-aa73-45a5dc770179&&Headline=In+a+crucified+state&strParent=strParentID','guest824','2008-09-02 13:36:49','for delivering the news'),(8092,'www.hin