CH HENIOUS ACTIONS WILL MAKE MORE AND MORE HEROES WHO ARE WILLING TO LAYDOWN THEIR LIFE FOR INDIA'),(8759,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=95d91929-d8d0-4f99-b230-e0f597eafdfe&&Headline=Timely+intervention+by+four+policemen+prevented+sixth+blast&strParent=strParentID','guest1243','2008-09-14 07:56:43','BY SPLASHING THE BRAVERY OF THESE HEROES ALL OVER THE MEDIA WILL CLEARLY DEMORALIZE THE TERRORISTS IN THE LONG RUN..AS IT WILL PROVE THAT THEIR TERRORIST ACTIVITIES IS MAKING INDIANS MORE STRONGER AND PASSIONATE ABOUT THEIR HOMELAND..JAI HIND'),(8760,'www.hindustantimes.com/storypage/storypage.aspx?sectionName=&id=faa2b418-b212-4750-a255-f639739bcee1&&Headline=Salim+Khan+denounces+Muslim+clerics&strParent=strParentID','guest2826','2008-09-14 08:08:02','Salim Saab i am proud of you.You are the true INDIAN.I am a hindu.But we are all INDIANS first and then hindu, muslim ,christian,sikh etc.I wish there were more Brothers from the Muslim fraternity who could express their unhappiness on the killings,infact butchering of the innocent people as you rightly put it.By increasing the security is not going to stop the killings but addressing these fanatics by the muslim community and letting them know that what they are doing is inhuman.I appeal to all the my muslim brothers and sisters to please be vocal and express it,so that the handful of fundalmentalists and fanatics because of whom every muslim is looked at with doubt.Keep up the good work salim saab as it is high profile and renowned people like you who can make the difference as i am just one of those common people.SRINI'),(8761,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=ViewsSectionPage&id=730f95ea-d250-4fc2-81ed-73834e54e344&&Headline=Thank+you,+Mr+Bush&strParent=strParentID','guest2472','2008-09-14 08:22:52','Indeed Bush has done a great deed for India.But come to think of it the \r\na'),(8762,'www.hindustantimes.com/storypage/storypage.aspx?sectionName=&id=faa2b418-