+unrest&strParent=strParentID','guest3361','2008-09-18 00:03:56','IT IS A STATE SPONSERED TERRORISM.CONVERSION IS AN INDIVIDUAL AFFAIR THERE IS NOTHING KNOWN AS FORCED CONVERSION. CONVERSIONS HAVE BEEN EXISTING SINCE THE LAST 2000 YEARS AND WILL CONTINUE BASED ON INDIVIDUAL CHOICE. WHO HAS MADE VHP AND BAJARANG DAL THE GUARDIANS OF HINDUS.? WHY DOES MR YEDURAPPA WANTS TO INVESTIGATE FORIEGN FUNDS NOW THE SAME COULD HAVE BEEN DONE EARLIER ALSO ADDITONALLY ALL FORIEGN FUNDS DETAILS ARE AVAILABLE WITH FERA. IT IS JUST AN HATRED CAMPAIGN BY BJP. INVESTIGATION NEEDS TO BE DONE FOR CHECKING FORIEGN FUND FLOWS TO BJP , VHP , BAJARANG DAL AND ALLIED PARTIES. THEY ARE SPONSERS OF TERROR AND DESTABILISHING THE COUNTRY. VHP AND BAJRANG DAL SHOULD BE BANNED.WHO GAVE THE POLICE PERMISSION TO ENTER CHURCHES AND HIT WOMAN , CHILDREN AND INNOCENT CHRISTIANS THE GOVERNMENT SHOULD BE BLAMED AND POLICE OFFICIALS SUSPENDED.INCIDENTS LIKE THIS LEAD TO BIRTH OF TERRORISTS WHICH INDIA IS ALREADY FACING DUE TO THE COMMUNAL HATRED.'),(9263,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest2023','2008-09-18 00:35:47','I agree with the facts in the first half(assuming they are true) but the rest is pure propaganda and make believe. Clearly the authorâ€™s objectivity is questionable his opinion reads like church literature'),(9264,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2972','2008-09-18 01:28:36','hi'),(9265,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2972','2008-09-18 01:29:00','r u there\\\''),(9266,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2972','2008-09-18 01:29:14','hhhhhhhhh'),(9267,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=98231e0f-e80d-4e76-9915-ada9d4cb876b&&Headline=Karnataka+offers+1,000+acres+for+Nano&strParent=strParentID','guest3393','2008-09-18 02:39:12','hello'),(9268,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3713','2008-09-18 03:28:34','Hello'),(9269,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3713','2008-09-18 03:28:43','Is there any