itution and its role during the freedom struggle. That is hog wash. The present day reality is that a whole lot of educated Muslims tacitly sympathize with these terrorists. I also have a feeling that terror mails were drafted by some some Jamia professor.'),(9631,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=LifeStyleSectionPage&id=669cc799-7932-4672-96d4-876a124ef7ff&&Headline=Hindi+news+and+the+art+of+repetition&strParent=strParentID','guest6801','2008-09-24 20:52:35','Yes! very true. The hindi news channels today have exclusives with them, but the amazing and shocking thing is that these channels buy these exclusives from the same store and that to in same brand and same color. But oopps!!! they are smart enough, they know how to give it a new attractive packing.  ROCK ON !!! Hindi news , great job !!!!'),(9632,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=LifeStyleSectionPage&id=669cc799-7932-4672-96d4-876a124ef7ff&&Headline=Hindi+news+and+the+art+of+repetition&strParent=strParentID','guest6801','2008-09-24 20:57:09','I am feeling sorry for ZEE news. It has started following India TV.  The Always Exclusive and BREAKING NEWS channel. I remember what India TV did, and the same ZEE followed this time in case of Taqueer. India TV flashed the exclusive that at 4 PM earth will shaken up. I expected it could be a warning from weather department but oops it was India TV. YES! India TV did it again, they ran the footage of recent China earthquake at 4 pm. Exclusive!!!!!'),(9633,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=India&id=0063fd83-c7ba-4d59-9778-58699648f103&&Headline=CEO+murder+result+of+yearlong+tussle&strParent=strParentID','guest5805','2008-09-24 21:07:15','this is too bad'),(9634,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6cd61a78-ba17-4a50-91cf-bcd7eda9e4d7warwithin_Special&&Headline=A+town+seething+with+rage','guest3518','2008-09-24 21:11:10','There is no excuse for terrorism