s in nailing the terrorists. As a result of this one will have to bear with these type of more incidents in th future. He should check where and by what actions of himself he gave the idea that he could be a terrorist and that would be very much useful for the other youngsters.'),(9865,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?id=b70cbb7e-abee-4366-81d3-5e478df4f5f0','guest3331','2008-09-29 01:14:09','http://energyenvoironmentforum.com'),(9866,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4746','2008-09-29 01:28:51','hi'),(9867,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=1a79beb5-4b29-447d-8df4-b42475f152b8&&Headline=Rahul+will+be+PM+sooner+or+later:+Sachin+Pilot','Rahul Swami','2008-09-29 03:24:39','Definately Rahul Gandhi will be a star campaigner and as Shri Sachin Pilot suggest that various measures have been taken by Congress party under its able leadership of Shri Rahul Gandhi to bring youth within the party. As it say 54% of the population is below 25 while almost 24% of the population is between 18-35 whereas it also constitute of 38% of the voting population, so will Congress go ahead and give representation to some young blood by introducing the youngest chief minister. Am sure if Congress can project one young chief minister it will have a fruitful impact on people, also it will stand tall. Am sure that given move will bring this youth of the country with congress which will not benefit in assembly election but will also show positive result in parliament elections which are round the corner. The given will have impact in two ways;'),(9868,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=1a79beb5-4b29-447d-8df4-b42475f152b8&&Headline=Rahul+will+be+PM+sooner+or+later:+Sachin+Pilot','Rahul Swami','2008-09-29 03:26:05','a) Youth are the people who go for maximum percentage of voting . There energy and influence can be felt on socity as a whole.'),(9869,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=1a79beb5-4b29-447d-