n+India,+a+tiny+group','guest2414','2008-10-12 04:04:39','As how national security advisor said about ISS of Pakistan, VHP,RSS & Bajrang Dal has to be destroyed for the prosperity of India.'),(10725,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=f5d6cfa8-fc71-40d0-a76a-64f41454c9e9&MatchID1=4813&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4813&Headline=Missionary+position','guest6203','2008-10-12 05:20:27','I agree, India is a secular country- but did the people have any choice in the matter at independence? Why don\\\'t we have a referendum on it to check the will of the people? In a democracy one must respect the wishes of the majority. Minority groups already have their own homelands in Pakistan, nagaland etc. The people of Gujrat have voted 3 times for Modi-democracy in practice. On a seperate note, I wonder where the outrage from this author was when Hindus were driven from Kashmir, Bangaldesh, pakistan etc. If he is ashamed then he can clearly move to Pakistan and see how well his ashamed hindu life will last there. As for christians who were affected in Andhra- what can you expect when you change your religion and still demand caste reservations despite the fact you claim there is no caste in christianity... clearly it is the christians who are to be ashamed. There are muslim homeland, christian homelabnds.. clearly it is time that there is a HIndu homeland where the rule of law is respected.'),(10726,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=f5d6cfa8-fc71-40d0-a76a-64f41454c9e9&MatchID1=4813&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4813&Headline=Missionary+position','guest6203','2008-10-12 05:25:57','And to add on, these communal clashes will continue as long as caste reservations and minority appeasement packages are in place at the expense of the majority. Muslims are unhappy? Move to Pakistan, that is the purpose of partition. Christians are unhappy? Move to northeast 