+world','guest8295','2008-10-25 10:50:01','Per the comment above - \\\"as yet undefined change\\\" - Obama has defined it exhaustively.  On his web site he has a policy statement 64 pages long.  It was written and posted in 2007 and none of his speeches have deviated from it. (I\\\'ve been listening because I love those policies) Over the course of the campaign his emphasis has changed but never the substance.  The change we are talking about is: affordable health care for all as a right, middle class focused economic policy, infrastructure and education focused investment, diplomacy focused foreign policy.  Isn\\\'t that enough?  My head is spinning already and the change hasn\\\'t even begun. Margaret Robin Kleinrock, Maine USA'),(13717,'dogtimemedia.com','oliver','2008-10-25 10:53:38','haha not at all, sorry I keep forgetting to check the chat window'),(13718,'dogtimemedia.com','ASTRID','2008-10-25 10:55:28','o'),(13719,'dogtimemedia.com','ASTRID','2008-10-25 10:55:33','its ok'),(13720,'dogtimemedia.com','ASTRID','2008-10-25 10:55:44','wait im coming'),(13721,'dogtimemedia.com','DTMCM ML','2008-10-25 10:57:07','â€œDear Guest ASTRID\n, \nWe at DogTime are focused on bringing pet lovers an enjoyable experience in our live PetChat. We moderate chat so that everyone can have a fun and educational experience. Please refrain from the use of offensive language, rude comments, or asking people for personal information.  \nThanks, the DogTime teamâ€'),(13722,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2929','2008-10-25 10:59:10','HI ALL'),(13723,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2929','2008-10-25 10:59:25','DOES ANY OF YOU GUYS HAVE A STAFFIE?'),(13724,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2929','2008-10-25 11:00:10','I HAVE JUST BOUGHT 2 MALES AND WOULD LIKE SOME ADIVE'),(13725,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2929','2008-10-25 11:00:22','aDVICE*'),(13726,'dogtimemedia.com','ASTRID','2008-10-25 11:01:15','whats advice?'),(13727,'dogtimemedia.com','ASTRID','2008-10-25 11:01:33','o'),(13728,'dogtimemedia.com','DTMCM ML'