ay+vs+Mumbai','guest2151','2008-10-26 01:58:46','a) Raj objected to Jaya\\\'s saying \\\'Hum UP ke hain\\\' and not to her speaking in Hindi per se.'),(14000,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=43e3dbc1-3022-4f30-9df4-b69801c2cae5&&Headline=Bombay+vs+Mumbai','guest2151','2008-10-26 02:01:18','b) Having nameboards in local languages is complusory in W.Bengal, Tamil Nadu, Karnataka and practically every other state in India. It is legally so in Maharashtra too for many years. Why the fuss if Raj asks people to follow the law?.'),(14001,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=43e3dbc1-3022-4f30-9df4-b69801c2cae5&&Headline=Bombay+vs+Mumbai','guest1732','2008-10-26 02:32:56','Please do n\r\not misinterprete the laws. Every Indian is entitled to use any language which he or she feels best. So what laws are about?'),(14002,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=43e3dbc1-3022-4f30-9df4-b69801c2cae5&&Headline=Bombay+vs+Mumbai','guest1732','2008-10-26 02:36:21','The question is about keeping Bombay to its original best!! The Thackeray family has hijacked Bombay for their political neccessity and hound people when when ever they feel of doing. It is shear mafia system.'),(14003,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2892','2008-10-26 02:41:02','hi'),(14004,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2892','2008-10-26 02:41:18','i have 3 cats'),(14005,'www.zeenews.com','guest6462','2008-10-26 03:54:01','ya i\\\'am completely agree with u all'),(14006,'www.zeenews.com','guest2095','2008-10-26 04:10:08','Sadhvi Pragya issue plotted by Maharashtra congress seems to be successful in cooling down the Bihari beating story in Maharashtra by MNS. Please note that so-called secular and also so called Bihari lover and UP lovers like Laloo, Mulayam and Paswan is keeping quite on North Indian beating issue in Maharashtra since the Hindu terrorist issue is plotted by Maharashtra congress. Congratulations to Congress poli